<title>USA: Unocal agrees to evaluate Uzbekistan crude, natgas.</title>
<headline>Unocal agrees to evaluate Uzbekistan crude, natgas.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unocal Corp said Monday that it has signed a deal with the Republic of Uzbekistan to evaluate the country's potential crude oil and natural gas resources.</p>
<p>The company also will study the feasibility of using part of Uzbekistan's existing pipeline network to tie into Unocal's proposed Central Asia Oil Pipeline (CAOP). The CAOP, when constructed, will link Central Asia oil producers to a new deepwater port on Pakistan's Arabian Sea coast.</p>
</text>
